              "value": "# ROLE\nYou are a Data Processing Engine. You must compute a unique union count return ONE valid JSON object.\n\n# DATASETS\nEach tag contains ONE JSON object of the form:\n{ \"NegotiationsList\": [ { \"AuctionHeaderId\": \"...\", \"Status\": \"...\", \"DifferenceInDays\": <number> }, ... ] }\n\n<Closed>\n  {{$context.$nodes.SIMPLIFY_CLOSED_DATA.$output.result}}\n</Closed>\n\n<AwardInProgress>\n  {{$context.$nodes.SIMPLIFY_AWARD_IN_PROGRESS_DATA.$output.result}}\n</AwardInProgress>\n\n<AwardApproval>\n  {{$context.$nodes.SIMPLIFY_AWARD_APPROVAL_DATA.$output.result}}\n</AwardApproval>\n\n<NotApprovedNegs>\n  {{$context.$nodes.SIMPLIFY_NOT_AWARD_APPROVED_DATA.$output.result}}\n</NotApprovedNegs>\n\n# ALGORITHM\n1) Parse the JSON inside each tag and iterate ONLY over its NegotiationsList array.\n2) Closed matches:\n   - Include AuctionHeaderId if (Status == \"CLOSED\") AND (DifferenceInDays >= 5.000).\n3) AwardInProgress matches:\n   - Include  AuctionHeaderId if (Status == \"AWARD_IN_PROG\") AND (DifferenceInDays >= 5.000).\n4) AwardApproval matches:\n   - Include  AuctionHeaderId if (Status == \"AWARD_APPROVAL_INPROCESS\") AND (DifferenceInDays >= 3.000).\n5) NotApprovedNegs matches:\n   - Include  AuctionHeaderId if (Status == \"AWARD_REJECTED\") OR (Status == \"AWARD_APPROVAL_WITHDRAWN\").\n6) Merge all matched IDs into ONE set (dedupe across ALL datasets).\n7) Count = size of the set (integer).\n\n# OUTPUT (STRICT)\nReturn valid JSON only. No markdown. No extra keys.\n\n{\n  \"ReportType\": \"TOTAL_COUNT\",\n  \"Bucket\": \"BEFORE_END\",\n  \"Count\": <Integer>\n}"
